#. これは、グランドピアノか…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is this...a grand piano?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>事件には…関係がなさそうだな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...don't think it's related to the case.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これは、グランドピアノか…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Is this...a grand piano?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>年季が入ってるし…
#. もしかして、結構な値打ち物なのかも…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It seems really old. I bet it's worth a lot of\n"
"money...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、弾いてくれる人がいないんじゃ、
#. 意味がないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Of course, without someone around who can play it,\n"
"it's totally useless.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Có"

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
